{"repositoryId":1419737519,"availability":"available","full":"chrisraro/ParaNaga","name":"ParaNaga","description":"Mobile-first commuter PWA for Naga City, Camarines Sur — know your ride, find your way. Next.js, TypeScript, Neon + PostGIS.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-14T19:26:43Z","updated":"2026-10-17T21:05:35Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://para-naga.vercel.app","topics":["jeepney","maplibre","naga-city","neon","nextjs","philippines","postgis","postgresql","public-transit","pwa","react","typescript"],"demo":"https://para-naga.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:35.299Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:35.299Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:35.299Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T11:49:35.299Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["ParaNaga is a mobile-first commuter web app (PWA) for Naga City, Camarines Sur, Philippines. It helps tourists, students, newcomers and residents answer the everyday questions: where to wait, which jeepney and direction to take, what it costs, where to transfer, and when to get off. People can also report corrections, share commuting tips, and privately report a driver, with a handoff to the city's official MyNaga app.","Status: early development. Foundation and the data import are built. A provisional planner covers Loops A and B on unverified pins, always badged, with no exact fares and no drawn path. No trip is presented as verified until reviewers publish checked route data."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chrisraro/ParaNaga/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"c71057345203fda43f61ef23836761969ee3b567a5d96f8bfa0ed6be2925913c","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:35.385Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:35.385Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"ParaNaga is a mobile-first commuter web app (PWA) for Naga